  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 83cd6b8211edbb34e830a40f09d7582f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Apprentices' Notes 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  journalText: "Apprentices' Notes 2\n\r\n\nT.E.A.R.S. = TRIP-OIL-Engined-Adaptive-Robotic-Suit\r\n\r\n-
    designed and build by the great FRANCIS CARTWRIGHT himself (what a legend\u2026)\r\n-
    designed for heavy work (would be great in a boxing ring too\u2026)\r\n- controlled
    only by trained pilots \r\n- the pilots can drink a bit of TRIP-OIL themselves
    while they work inside the T.E.A.R.S.; they say it reduces hunger and thirst
    and brings their concentration to the next Level (would love to test this shit
    by myself one day)\r\n- heavily armored, crazy strength, adaptive limbs \r\n-
    very resistant to heat and pressure\r\n\r\n\r\nPersonal thoughts: \r\n\r\nSome
    engineers are whispering and I feel a weird tension in the air. Supervisor Alfred
    is giving me goosebumps sometimes\u2026 The way he looks around and how he talks
    to himself from time to time\u2026 I understand why no one seems to like him
    here. I think I will keep these notes hidden - just in case."
  textAudio: {fileID: 0}
